ons about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Responding to Good and Bad News", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Here are the different ways to respond to good and bad news.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Examples </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To respond to good news\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Congratulations! <br />That's great/fantastic/wonderful! <br />What great/fantastic/wonderful news! <br />That's great/fantastic/wonderful news! <br />I'm glad to hear that!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To respond to bad news\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Oh no/dear! <br />That's too bad! <br />I can't believe it! <br />I'm sorry to hear that ... <br />That's unfortunate/awful! <br />I know how you must be feeling!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Modal Can", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modal can for 3 things:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<li> to ask and talk about what is possible.  <li> to say you have an ability or know how to  do something.  <li>to ask for permission or give someone permission.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Use</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Examples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Possibility\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Can you please wait? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ability\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I can write it down. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Permission\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I speak to Mr. Jones, please?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "in response to ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that you say or write as a reaction to something else ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm calling in response to your voicemail.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words to review!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "voicemail ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a recorded message a person leaves on the phone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am listening to your voicemail.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "news ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "new information ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have some bad news!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to regret ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to say that you are sorry for something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I regret to inform you that you are not who we are looking for.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to write down ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to write something on a piece of paper ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let me write it down for you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to come up ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to appear ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My e-mails aren't coming up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share some good or bad news with them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner responds to the news.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I find a partner to role-play an activity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give good or bad news to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I respond to good or bad news.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}